# Everything here is captured from the SDK emulator, frame by frame from its framebuffer. Kept out
# of Git LFS, the same exemption resources/images/ uses for the build icons, so a plain clone shows
# them. It is all small -- a couple of kilobytes a still, tens for an animation -- because every
# frame is a handful of GColor8 levels.
*.png  !filter !diff !merge -text
*.gif  !filter !diff !merge -text
